# Vile Mutilator: "As an additional cost to cast this spell, sacrifice a creature or enchantment." (CR 118.8, 601.2b). Bot1
# has seven mana (a Swamp, three Moxen and a Black Lotus tapped for three black) but only artifacts that are no creatures:
# the Moxen and the Lotus cannot be sacrificed for it, so the Mutilator is not offered. Once Bot1 casts its Memnite the same
# cast is offered, sacrifices the Memnite and, Bot2 having no permanents, nothing else happens (the Island in its graveyard is its cleanup discard to seven).

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Mox Emerald
Black Lotus
Memnite
Island
Vile Mutilator
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

